{"series":{"id":"fairy-mountain","slug":"fairy-mountain","title":"Fairy Mountain","image":"https://donghualife.com/images/webp/fairy-mountain-1__coverImage.webp","synopsis":"El emperador de las llanuras centrales estuvo desaparecido durante varios meses. La reina madre ordenó a Li Mao, el general de Yulinwei, y Wei Xian, miembro del personal de la corte interior, que buscaran en secreto el paradero del emperador. En el camino, los dos se encontraron con Zong Sheng, un joven artista marcial que se convertía en un niño cuando lloraba, Brahma, un adolescente de dos años que perdió parte de su memoria, y Liang Chen, una tía taoísta amable y tenaz que sufría de problemas en las piernas. No todos se conocen, pero tienen sus propios objetivos. La fuente de todo el caos parece apuntar a la misteriosa y misteriosa montaña de hadas y al secreto de la inmortalidad.","genres":["Acción","Aventura","Fantasía","Historia"],"sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/series/fairy-mountain","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:39:44.196Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"fairy-mountain-1","slug":"fairy-mountain-1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/fairy-mountain-1-1","image":null,"number":1,"seriesId":"fairy-mountain","firstEpisodeUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/fairy-mountain-1-1","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:39:55.804Z","episodeCount":17,"minEpisodeFound":1,"maxEpisodeFound":17,"missingEpisodes":[],"paginationComplete":true,"initialSyncComplete":true}],"episodes":[{"id":"fairy-mountain-1-1","slug":"fairy-mountain-1-1","title":"Fairy Mountain — Cap. 1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/fairy-mountain-1-1","servers":[],"previousUrl":null,"nextUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/fairy-mountain-1-2","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:39:44.749Z","seriesId":"fairy-mountain","seasonId":"fairy-mountain-1","number":1,"releaseDate":null},{"id":"fairy-mountain-1-2","slug":"fairy-mountain-1-2","title":"Fairy Mountain — Cap. 2","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/fairy-mountain-1-2","servers":[],"previous